<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on LIFFE BTP-Future.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on LIFFE BTP-Future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank, N.A. in New York, Frankfurt branch has issued 16 million American-style call and put warrants, in eight equal tranches, on the LIFFE BTP-Future, lead manager Citibank Aktiengesellschaft said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 02.DEC.96-19.FEB.98   PAYDATE	02.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE	   PRICE</p>
<p> CALL	   125.0 PCT	6,475 ITL</p>
<p> PUT	    125.0 PCT	4,285 ITL</p>
<p> CALL	   129.0 PCT	4,485 ITL</p>
<p> PUT	    129.0 PCT	6,100 ITL</p>
<p> CALL	   132.0 PCT	3,265 ITL</p>
<p> PUT	    132.0 PCT	7,745 ITL</p>
<p> CALL	   136.0 PCT	2,180 ITL</p>
<p> PUT	    136.0 PCT	10,510 ITL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
